{
  "name": "agent-pi",
  "image": "ubuntu:24.04",
  "workspaceFolder": "${localWorkspaceFolder}",
  "workspaceMount": "source=${localWorkspaceFolder},target=${localWorkspaceFolder},type=bind",

  "//": [
    "Containment for `pi`, replacing the renv + sandbox wrapper. pi ships no",
    "sandbox of its own and says so in its security doc -- isolation has to come",
    "from the OS or a container -- so unlike claude there is nothing to move into",
    "pi's own config. This file IS the boundary.",
    "",
    "Mount ORDER is load-bearing: a read-only pin nested inside a writable tree",
    "only holds if it is applied after the tree. Whether that survives translation",
    "to podman argv is what the check script exists to prove.",
    "",
    "overrideCommand MUST be true. With false, the CLI's keep-alive script ends in",
    "`exec \"$@\"` and $@ is the image command -- /bin/bash for ubuntu:24.04 -- which",
    "replaces the shell and then exits on EOF because no stdin is attached. The",
    "container starts, runs nothing, exits 0, and the CLI reports only 'An error",
    "occurred setting up the container'.",
    "",
    "Do NOT run with the workspace set to ~/dotfiles: workspaceMount and the",
    "read-only dotfiles bind below would share a destination, and podman rejects a",
    "duplicate mount destination outright rather than letting the later one win,",
    "which is how docker behaves. Use a project under ~/projects.",
    "",
    "`--security-opt label=disable` is deliberately absent: the CLI emits it itself.",
    "Note the CLI keys containers on the workspace-folder label and will `podman",
    "start` a stale one rather than recreate it, so a config change appears to do",
    "nothing until the old container is removed.",
    "",
    "No API keys cross as environment variables. initializeCommand runs on the",
    "HOST before the container is created, so it can reach gpg-agent; it drops the",
    "asta key into a mode-0600 file under XDG_RUNTIME_DIR (tmpfs, gone at logout)",
    "and only that one file is mounted in. mcp.json reads it with `!cat`, which",
    "pi-mcp-adapter runs lazily when the server first connects. The password store",
    "and gnupg stay masked as empty tmpfs below.",
    "",
    "AGENT_BRANCH_PREFIX is not passed either: the guardrails extension sets it",
    "itself (extensions/guardrails.ts). OPENROUTER_API_KEY is not passed because",
    "provider credentials belong in pi's own auth.json via /login, which is where",
    "opencode-go, deepseek and openai-codex already live."
  ],

  "initializeCommand": "d=\"${localEnv:XDG_RUNTIME_DIR}/pi\"; umask 077; mkdir -p \"$d\"; touch \"$d/asta-key\"; k=$(pass show asta-mcp 2>/dev/null | head -n1 || true); if [ -n \"$k\" ]; then printf %s \"$k\" > \"$d/asta-key\"; fi",

  "mounts": [
    "source=/usr,target=/usr,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/opt,target=/opt,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/etc/ssl,target=/etc/ssl,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/etc/ca-certificates,target=/etc/ca-certificates,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/bin,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/bin,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/share/fnm,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/share/fnm,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/share/bun,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/share/bun,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.config/git,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.config/git,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.agents,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.agents,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.config,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.config,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/org/roam,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/org/roam,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/org/agenda,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/org/agenda,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/projects,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/projects,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.cache,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.cache,type=bind",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/share,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/share,type=bind",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/state/nvim,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/state/nvim,type=bind",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/state/headroom,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/state/headroom,type=bind",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/org/agents,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/org/agents,type=bind",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.config/pi/agent/sessions,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.config/pi/agent/sessions,type=bind",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.config/pi/agent/npm,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.config/pi/agent/npm,type=bind",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.config/pi/agent/mcp-cache.json,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.config/pi/agent/mcp-cache.json,type=bind",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.config/pi/agent/run-history.jsonl,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.config/pi/agent/run-history.jsonl,type=bind",
    "source=${localEnv:XDG_RUNTIME_DIR}/pi/asta-key,target=/run/pi/asta-key,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.agents/guardrails,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.agents/guardrails,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.claude/hooks,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.claude/hooks,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.claude/settings.json,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.claude/settings.json,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.config/pi/agent/extensions,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.config/pi/agent/extensions,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.config/pi/agent/settings.json,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.config/pi/agent/settings.json,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.config/sandbox,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.config/sandbox,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.config/renv,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.config/renv,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.config/git/hooks,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.config/git/hooks,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.local/scripts,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.local/scripts,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.local/share/gnupg/gpg-agent.conf,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.local/share/gnupg/gpg-agent.conf,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.config/zsh,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.config/zsh,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.zshenv,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.zshenv,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.bashrc,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.bashrc,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.bash_profile,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/dotfiles/.bash_profile,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/share/bun/bin,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/share/bun/bin,type=bind,readonly",
    "source=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/share/claude,target=/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/share/claude,type=bind,readonly"
  ],
  "runArgs": [
    "--userns=keep-id",
    "--network=host",
    "--http-proxy=false",
    "--tmpfs",
    "/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/share/gnupg:ro,nosuid,nodev,mode=0000,notmpcopyup",
    "--tmpfs",
    "/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/share/pass:ro,nosuid,nodev,mode=0000,notmpcopyup",
    "--tmpfs",
    "/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/share/password-store:ro,nosuid,nodev,mode=0000,notmpcopyup",
    "--tmpfs",
    "/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/share/keyrings:ro,nosuid,nodev,mode=0000,notmpcopyup",
    "--tmpfs",
    "/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/share/mail:ro,nosuid,nodev,mode=0000,notmpcopyup",
    "--tmpfs",
    "/u/71/ibrahin1/unix/.local/share/zsh:ro,nosuid,nodev,mode=0000,notmpcopyup",
    "--tmpfs",
    "/tmp:rw,nosuid,nodev,mode=1777"
  ],
  "overrideCommand": true,
  "updateRemoteUserUID": false
}
